y, settings, workspace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="540" width="440" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer5" value="L5" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="654" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_ocr" value="&lt;b&gt;ocr&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;ingest · ocr · events · ocr_fix (stages 1-4) · subtitle_style · geometry&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: infra, kernel, llm, memory, settings, workspace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="630" width="440" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_voice" value="&lt;b&gt;voice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;audio · voice (stages 5-6, bootstrap centroids) · learning.py (voice bank, 5.8a)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: infra, kernel, memory, settings, workspace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="630" width="440" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer4" value="L4" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="744" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_memory" value="&lt;b&gt;memory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;store (reads) · manager/ (the only writer) · evidence · prefix · briefings · briefing_gen · dreaming · probation · character_updates · characters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: infra, kernel, llm, settings, workspace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="720" width="900" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer3" value="L3" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="834" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_workspace" value="&lt;b&gt;workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;episodes (registry) · context (EpisodeContext) · state (state.json) · series&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: infra, kernel, llm, settings&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="810" width="900" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer2" value="L2" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="924" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_infra" value="&lt;b&gt;infra&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;media (ffmpeg / ffprobe) · device (GPU / CPU) · joblock&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: kernel, settings&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="900" width="440" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_llm" value="&lt;b&gt;llm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;client.py: providers, disk cache, cost records, budget, prompt loading&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: kernel, settings&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="900" width="440" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer1" value="L1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1014" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_settings" value="&lt;b&gt;settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;config (config.yaml + series.yaml) · registers (translation styles) · schema · yaml_edit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: kernel&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="990" width="900" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer0" value="L0" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1104" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m_kernel" value="&lt;b&gt;kernel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;models (every artifact) · errors · util · textutil · progress&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px' color='#555555'&gt;uses: nothing&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="1080" width="900" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="down" value="imports point&lt;br&gt;only downwards&lt;br&gt;(any lower layer)" style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;width=14;endSize=8;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" edge="1"><mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60" y="80" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="60" y="1140" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="app" value="app/  (desktop app, PySide6)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="60" width="420" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="views" value="&lt;b&gt;views/, main_window, widgets, preview, __main__&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;screens; import from the core only &lt;b&gt;subagent.kernel&lt;/b&gt; (data types, errors)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="100" width="380" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="services" value="&lt;b&gt;app/services/&lt;/b&gt; (the app's only door into the core)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;core.py: Services, ReviewData&lt;br&gt;settings · episodes · review · audit · memory · bootstrap: what each area's screens use, re-exported lazily&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="250" width="380" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jobs" value="&lt;b&gt;jobs.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;long work runs the CLI in a child process (QProcess, --progress json)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="420" width="380" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_views_services" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" parent="1" source="views" target="services" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_services_core" value="package APIs only" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="services" target="m_pipeline" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_jobs_cli" value="python -m subagent …" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="jobs" target="m_cli" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_views_kernel" value="subagent.kernel" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="views" target="m_kernel" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt; (tests/test_architecture.py checks every import, function-level ones too)&lt;br&gt;• A module's &lt;b&gt;__init__.py&lt;/b&gt; is its public API: names in __all__, re-exported lazily (submodule loads on first use).&lt;br&gt;• Other modules import &lt;b&gt;from subagent.&amp;lt;module&amp;gt; import name&lt;/b&gt; only: never a submodule path, never a _private name.&lt;br&gt;• Inside a module, files import each other directly.&lt;br&gt;• cast → voice is the one sideways edge allowed. subagent never imports app or PySide6.&lt;br&gt;• Stage modules are named by path in pipeline/stages.py and imported when the stage runs." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="610" width="420" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend0" value="pipeline stages + their learning" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="870" width="200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend1" value="memory" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="870" width="200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend2" value="orchestration / review / output" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="910" width="200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend3" value="foundation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="910" width="200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>